# Biomes — Architecture & Rules

## Stack
- **UI:** `index.html` in WebView2 (`src/ui/webview_window.cpp`)
- **IPC hub:** `src/main.cpp` — JSON via `postMessage`
- **Overlay:** `src/ui/grid_overlay.cpp` — zones drawn on `rcWork` per monitor
- **Window engine:** `src/core/window_scaler.cpp` — snap, launch, session close
- **Store/Obsidian:** `src/core/app_launcher.cpp` — AUMID + URI launch
- **Monitors:** `src/core/monitor_manager.cpp` — single source of truth for `rcWork`
- **Persistence:** `config/biomes.json` (local only, next to exe)

See also: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Session model (V1)
- **Open biome:** `PrepareCleanSlate` → force-snap each zone → `RaiseBiomeWindows` → minimize dashboard
- **Close biome:** `CloseBiomeSession` — restore pre-biome size for each biome app, then minimize; non-biome windows stay minimized
- **Snap:** always use saved JSON geometry (`ForceSnapToBox`), not last HWND position; exit Electron fullscreen first
- **Restore:** `WINDOWPLACEMENT` for biome session close; never `GetWindowRect` on iconic windows

## IPC — do not break message shapes
UI→native: `CREATE_NEW_BIOME`, `SAVE_BIOME`, `DELETE_BIOME`, `ACTIVATE_BIOME`, `GET_SAVED_BIOMES`, `CLOSE_BIOME`
Native→UI: `LOADED_BIOMES`, `GRID_LAYOUT_READY`, `STATUS`, `ACTIVE_BIOME_CHANGED`
Escape all user strings with `EscapeJsonString()` before embedding in JSON.

## Change discipline
- Read `.hpp` headers before calling C++ APIs
- Small diffs only; do not rewrite whole modules unless asked
- No new third-party deps (Win32 + nlohmann/json + WebView2 only)
- Test with `build/Release/Biomes.exe` after native changes
- Live path is `main.cpp` + `WindowScaler` + `AppLauncher` (no legacy BiomeManager)
